cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SILT in your research, please cite this software and the accompanying patent application."
title: "SILT: Skill Interchange Layer with Trust-gating — a trust gate for AI learning"
abstract: >-
  SILT is a local-first adapter that moves inspectable skill packets between two
  AI modules under an evaluation gate: a skill is admitted to the receiver only
  after it proves itself on cases the teacher never saw, with a non-bypassable
  all-or-nothing gate, structural human sign-off for high-risk domains, a
  hash-chained tamper-evident audit trail, and per-skill rollback. Patent pending (India).
authors:
